        "created_at": "2017-07-24T04:41:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If multiple spirits choose to gain power cards during the same growth phase, is it acceptable for them to all draw their cards at once and then confer before deciding which ones to keep?</p><p>Is this still true for gaining power cards off of powers? &nbsp;Does it matter if the two spirits are gaining the cards from seperate powers or from the same power?</p>",
