        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>For gaining power cards off of powers, I would say that, at least in principle, one power needs to be resolved completely before starting on another one. (In practice, often everyone can do things at once, as long as you synchronize at the end of the Spirit Phase.)</p><p>During the growth phase, I&#39;ve often heard people informally compare notes about future plans while picking cards, and that&#39;s fine. I don&#39;t see anything wrong with comparing notes about power card draws, though as with all this planning it&#39;s worth putting time limits on it. (But it didn&#39;t come up in testing.)</p>",
